    <ol class="steps-list">
        <li>Register as a library member.</li>
        <li>Search for the book you need.</li>
        <li>Check whether the book is available.</li>
        <li>Submit a borrowing request.</li>
        <li>Follow the library's borrowing and return rules.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

