        <ul class="rules-list">
            <li>Maintain silence and respect other readers.</li>
            <li>Handle library books and equipment carefully.</li>
            <li>Return borrowed books by the agreed date.</li>
            <li><strong>Do not damage, write in or remove library materials without permission.</strong></li>
            <li>Keep the library clean and organised.</li>
